      } ]
    }
  },
  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\"><strong>Apologise to the customer:<br /></strong><br />&ldquo;I sincerely apologise that our correspondence was not what you expected as a customer.&rdquo;<br />OR<br />&ldquo;I&rsquo;m sorry about this. I am hearing we didn&rsquo;t make a good impression on you with how we&rsquo;ve phrased things to you.&rdquo;<br /><br /><strong>Acknowledge feedback:<br /></strong><br />&ldquo;Thank you for raising this with us, I&rsquo;ve recorded your feedback and will include it in our regular review of how we can do things differently.&rdquo;<br />AND/OR<br />\"Please be assured that we do review complaints to ensure we maintain appropriate service levels.\"<br />AND/OR<br />\"Your complaint is reported internally to show what training and support is needed for our staff.\"<br /><br />*note: complaints about default notifices or other collections correspondence may present a hardship trigger- discuss with your People Leader and consider if it should be transferred to a Specialist Hardship Complaints team.</div>",
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "controlWidth" : 12
}

