  "text" : "<div style=\"font-size: 15px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; height: 200px; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #e8e8e8;\"><strong>Provide information to the customer:<br /><br /></strong>&lt;if applicable, provide any additional information or support requested by the customer. Eg. Consider referring to the <a href=\"https://www.anz.com.au/support/\" title=\"ANZ Support Center page on anz.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ANZ Support Center page on anz.com</a>&gt;<br /><br /><strong>Check for additional issues:<br /></strong><br />\"Were there any other issues you wanted to raise?\"<br /><br />*note: if the customer raises serious allegations about the staff interaction- discuss with your People Leader and consider if it should be transferred to a Specialist Complaints team.<br /><br /><strong>By clicking Next, you will be directed back to the Choose Pathway page to Consider Additional Issues</strong>&nbsp;<br /><br /></div>",
  "label" : "TextBlock1",
  "controlWidth" : 12,
  "lwcComponentOverride" : ""
}

